-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against the level's whole
              recording, both builds; simulated boot; run in OverSpec from its
              menu into play with Enhanced on. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      NexClash differential verification on the rzxarchive's whole
              recording of level 2 (19,887 frames), both builds: every
              register with R and all game memory after every draw pass and
              screen flip, the sprites against a model of the game's drawing
              and against the visible screen each frame, the painted pixels
              against the painted map -> IDENTICAL; unit cases PASS; every
              broken build detected.

  Emulator    OverSpec: from the patch menu with Enhanced on, past the level
              intro into play, scripted keys

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
